# 🔧 Osta Plus
### *"Book a Technician, Not a Headache"*

---

## The Problem

In Egypt, if you have a plumbing or electrical issue at 11 PM, what do you do?

You scroll through Facebook groups, call a stranger, wait for hours, and have no idea if a real professional is going to show up. No ratings, no guarantees, no price transparency.

## The Solution

**Osta Plus** is a platform that connects customers with **verified, rated** professional technicians — think *Uber, but for home services*.

---

## 🎯 User Journey

```
Customer opens the app
        │
        ▼
Searches for a "plumber" in their area
        │
        ▼
Views the technician's profile: rating, experience, offered services
        │
        ▼
Books an appointment
   (the system checks the technician is actually free at that time)
        │
        ▼
Pays securely online (Stripe)
   — optionally applying a discount coupon
        │
        ▼
Technician completes the job
        │
        ▼
Customer rates and reviews
        │
        ▼
Technician earns money and can withdraw it to their wallet
```

---

## 💡 What Sets Osta Plus Apart

| Feature | Why It Matters |
|---|---|
| ✅ **Verified technicians** | Admins review and verify every technician before they're visible to customers |
| 💳 **Secure payments + coupons** | Real Stripe integration, not just "cash on delivery" |
| 🗓️ **Appointment overlap prevention** | A technician can't accidentally double-book the same time slot — the system enforces it |
| 💰 **Transparent earnings system** | Technicians see exactly what they've earned and can request a payout through their preferred method |
| 💬 **Real-time chat** | Customers and technicians can coordinate details before the technician arrives |
| ⭐ **Genuine reviews** | Only customers who actually completed a booking can leave a review |

