## 🏗️ Technical Highlights

Built on **real Clean Architecture** — not just a buzzword, an actual layered solution:

```
Osta.API
   │
   ▼
Osta.Core (composition root)
   │
   ├── Osta.Service
   ├── Osta.Booking
   ├── Osta.Payment
   └── Osta.Notification
   │
   ▼
Osta.Infrastructure
   │
   ▼
Osta.Identity
   │
   ▼
Osta.Domain
   │
   ▼
Osta.SharedKernel
```

| Technology | Role |
|---|---|
| **CQRS + MediatR** | Every action is a Command or Query with its own handler and validator |
| **Stripe** | Payment Intents, webhook-driven status confirmation, refunds |
| **RabbitMQ** | Asynchronous notification delivery (e.g. payout-completed emails) |
| **Hangfire** | Scheduled background jobs (appointment reminders) |
| **SignalR** | Real-time chat delivery |
| **Redis** | Caching for high-read endpoints (Categories/Services) |
| **JWT + RBAC** | Secured with fine-grained permissions, plus Google OAuth login |

